{
  "esm": "0.6.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "duo_subdivide_refine",
    "description": "DUO icosahedral one-level subdivision as a value-invention FAQ pass (RFC semiring-faq-unified-ir \u00a77.3; bead esd-heg.3). The \u00a77.3 skolem/distinct/rank value-invention applied to mesh refinement, replacing the imperative _midpoint! + body of _subdivide_icosahedron (src/grids/duo.jl). The chain: (1) edge_set \u2014 the index-set-producing aggregate (semiring bool_and_or, distinct:true) that mints a midpoint vertex per unique undirected edge of the face->vertex connectivity, keyed by a canonical Skolem over the (sorted) endpoint vertex ids; (2) edges \u2014 exposed as a kind:derived index set via from_faq; (3) edge_dense_id \u2014 rank to dense ids (the array-backend index, \u00a75.7 sorted order); (4) mid_coord \u2014 the geometry FAQ: the normalized average of the two endpoints (mid_sum / sqrt(mid_sq)); (5) child_vert \u2014 the join of each face to its three edge-midpoints (edge_of_face) emitting four sub-faces in the order (a,ab,ca),(b,bc,ab),(c,ca,bc),(ab,bc,ca). Value-free structural spec (the connectivity/coords are parameter shapes; concrete data is fed by the conformance harness), mirroring tests/valid/aggregate/edge_enumeration_area_eff.esm in ESS. Index sizes are the canonical level-0->1 instance (Nc=20, Nv=12, Ne=30, 4*Nc child sub-faces); the pass shape is identical at any level. Byte/numeric equivalence to the imperative subdivision step is proven across the level ladder by test/test_duo_subdivision_faq.jl.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciDiscretizations/gastown.nux"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "duo",
      "icosahedral",
      "subdivision",
      "value-invention",
      "skolem",
      "distinct",
      "rank",
      "faq",
      "esd-heg.3"
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "IcosahedralRefine": {
      "index_sets": {
        "faces": {
          "kind": "interval",
          "size": 20
        },
        "verts": {
          "kind": "interval",
          "size": 12
        },
        "corners": {
          "kind": "interval",
          "size": 3
        },
        "space": {
          "kind": "interval",
          "size": 3
        },
        "child_in_face": {
          "kind": "interval",
          "size": 4
        },
        "edges": {
          "kind": "derived",
          "from_faq": "edge_set"
        }
      },
      "variables": {
        "face_vert": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "shape": [
            "faces",
            "corners"
          ],
          "description": "Vertex ids of each face's three corners (level-n connectivity, CONST)."
        },
        "vert_coord": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "shape": [
            "verts",
            "space"
          ],
          "description": "Cartesian unit-sphere coordinates of the level-n vertices (CONST)."
        },
        "edge_of_face": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "shape": [
            "faces",
            "corners"
          ],
          "description": "Dense (1-based) edge id of each face's local edge le in {1,2,3} = corner-pairs (1,2),(2,3),(3,1); the inversion join of edge_set (RFC \u00a75.2), the edges_on_face connectivity. New midpoint vertex index = Nv + edge_of_face[f,le]."
        },
        "edge_lo": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "shape": [
            "edges"
          ],
          "description": "Lower endpoint vertex id of each dense edge (the Skolem key's first component), keyed by dense edge id."
        },
        "edge_hi": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "shape": [
            "edges"
          ],
          "description": "Upper endpoint vertex id of each dense edge (the Skolem key's second component), keyed by dense edge id."
        },
        "edge_exists": {
          "type": "state",
          "shape": [
            "edges"
          ],
          "description": "Membership over the derived edges set (the index-set-producing aggregate output)."
        },
        "edge_dense_id": {
          "type": "state",
          "shape": [
            "edges"
          ],
          "description": "Dense integer ids over the derived edges set (rank), \u00a75.7 sorted order."
        },
        "mid_sum": {
          "type": "state",
          "shape": [
            "edges",
            "space"
          ],
          "description": "Un-normalized midpoint = elementwise sum of the two endpoint coordinates."
        },
        "mid_sq": {
          "type": "state",
          "shape": [
            "edges"
          ],
          "description": "Squared norm of mid_sum, reduced over space (sum_product FAQ)."
        },
        "mid_coord": {
          "type": "state",
          "shape": [
            "edges",
            "space"
          ],
          "description": "Invented midpoint vertex coordinates = mid_sum / sqrt(mid_sq) (normalized average; on the unit sphere)."
        },
        "child_vert": {
          "type": "state",
          "shape": [
            "faces",
            "child_in_face",
            "corners"
          ],
          "description": "Vertex id of output corner cc of sub-face t of face f \u2014 the four emitted children, joining face corners to the three invented edge-midpoints."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "_comment": "(1)+(2) edge_set: unique undirected edges (= midpoint vertices) from the face->corner connectivity. distinct:true under bool_and_or dedups; ranges iterate each face f and its corner pairs (ca,cb); filter ca<cb takes each pair once; key mints skolem(edge, vid_a, vid_b) over the corner vertex ids; the true body marks existence. Referenced by index_sets.edges.from_faq via id.",
          "lhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "edge_exists",
              "edge"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "id": "edge_set",
            "args": [
              "face_vert"
            ],
            "semiring": "bool_and_or",
            "distinct": true,
            "output_idx": [
              "edge"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "f": {
                "from": "faces"
              },
              "ca": {
                "from": "corners"
              },
              "cb": {
                "from": "corners"
              }
            },
            "filter": {
              "op": "<",
              "args": [
                "ca",
                "cb"
              ]
            },
            "key": {
              "op": "skolem",
              "args": [
                "edge",
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "face_vert",
                    "f",
                    "ca"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "face_vert",
                    "f",
                    "cb"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "true",
              "args": []
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "(3) rank: dense ids over the derived edges set by position in the sorted distinct sequence (\u00a75.5/\u00a75.7.3).",
          "lhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "edge_dense_id",
              "e"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [],
            "semiring": "sum_product",
            "output_idx": [
              "e"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "e": {
                "from": "edges"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "rank",
              "args": [
                "edges"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "(4a) mid_sum[e,d] = v[edge_lo[e],d] + v[edge_hi[e],d] (elementwise over edges x space).",
          "lhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "mid_sum",
              "e",
              "d"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [
              "vert_coord",
              "edge_lo",
              "edge_hi"
            ],
            "semiring": "sum_product",
            "output_idx": [
              "e",
              "d"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "e": {
                "from": "edges"
              },
              "d": {
                "from": "space"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "+",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "vert_coord",
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "edge_lo",
                        "e"
                      ]
                    },
                    "d"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "vert_coord",
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "edge_hi",
                        "e"
                      ]
                    },
                    "d"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "(4b) mid_sq[e] = sum_d mid_sum[e,d]^2 (the squared norm; sum_product over space).",
          "lhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "mid_sq",
              "e"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [
              "mid_sum"
            ],
            "semiring": "sum_product",
            "output_idx": [
              "e"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "e": {
                "from": "edges"
              },
              "d": {
                "from": "space"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "mid_sum",
                    "e",
                    "d"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "mid_sum",
                    "e",
                    "d"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "(4c) mid_coord[e,d] = mid_sum[e,d] / sqrt(mid_sq[e]) \u2014 the normalized-average midpoint on the unit sphere.",
          "lhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "mid_coord",
              "e",
              "d"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [
              "mid_sum",
              "mid_sq"
            ],
            "semiring": "sum_product",
            "output_idx": [
              "e",
              "d"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "e": {
                "from": "edges"
              },
              "d": {
                "from": "space"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "mid_sum",
                    "e",
                    "d"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "sqrt",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "mid_sq",
                        "e"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "(5) child_vert[f,t,cc]: emit 4 sub-faces per face. a,b,c = face corner vertices; ab,bc,ca = Nv + edge_of_face[f,le] the invented edge-midpoints. Order (a,ab,ca),(b,bc,ab),(c,ca,bc),(ab,bc,ca) matches the imperative _subdivide_icosahedron emission so children line up position-for-position.",
          "lhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "child_vert",
              "f",
              "t",
              "cc"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [
              "face_vert",
              "edge_of_face"
            ],
            "semiring": "sum_product",
            "output_idx": [
              "f",
              "t",
              "cc"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "f": {
                "from": "faces"
              },
              "t": {
                "from": "child_in_face"
              },
              "cc": {
                "from": "corners"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "ifelse",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "==",
                  "args": [
                    "t",
                    1
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "ifelse",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "==",
                      "args": [
                        "cc",
                        1
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "face_vert",
                        "f",
                        1
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "ifelse",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "==",
                          "args": [
                            "cc",
                            2
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            12,
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "edge_of_face",
                                "f",
                                1
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            12,
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "edge_of_face",
                                "f",
                                3
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "ifelse",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "==",
                      "args": [
                        "t",
                        2
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "ifelse",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "==",
                          "args": [
                            "cc",
                            1
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "index",
                          "args": [
                            "face_vert",
                            "f",
                            2
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "ifelse",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "==",
                              "args": [
                                "cc",
                                2
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                12,
                                {
                                  "op": "index",
                                  "args": [
                                    "edge_of_face",
                                    "f",
                                    2
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                12,
                                {
                                  "op": "index",
                                  "args": [
                                    "edge_of_face",
                                    "f",
                                    1
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "ifelse",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "==",
                          "args": [
                            "t",
                            3
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "ifelse",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "==",
                              "args": [
                                "cc",
                                1
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "face_vert",
                                "f",
                                3
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "ifelse",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "==",
                                  "args": [
                                    "cc",
                                    2
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "+",
                                  "args": [
                                    12,
                                    {
                                      "op": "index",
                                      "args": [
                                        "edge_of_face",
                                        "f",
                                        3
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "+",
                                  "args": [
                                    12,
                                    {
                                      "op": "index",
                                      "args": [
                                        "edge_of_face",
                                        "f",
                                        2
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "ifelse",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "==",
                              "args": [
                                "cc",
                                1
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                12,
                                {
                                  "op": "index",
                                  "args": [
                                    "edge_of_face",
                                    "f",
                                    1
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "ifelse",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "==",
                                  "args": [
                                    "cc",
                                    2
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "+",
                                  "args": [
                                    12,
                                    {
                                      "op": "index",
                                      "args": [
                                        "edge_of_face",
                                        "f",
                                        2
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "+",
                                  "args": [
                                    12,
                                    {
                                      "op": "index",
                                      "args": [
                                        "edge_of_face",
                                        "f",
                                        3
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
